  "description": "A self-contained delimited-text (RFC 4180 CSV/TSV) library for .NET 8, shaped after System.Text.Json and matching the sibling Bodu.Text.Toml surface: the forward-only ref-struct Utf8DelimitedReader/Utf8DelimitedWriter token surface over UTF-8, a mutable DelimitedNode DOM, a read-only DelimitedDocument DOM, and the DelimitedSerializer record mapper with an IAsyncEnumerable streaming surface. A delimited document is an array of records.",
